831
00:31:22.440 --> 00:31:23.800
So, you know,

832
00:31:23.980 --> 00:31:28.400
you don't respond quite the same way because you want to make sure they finish their sentence or

833
00:31:28.400 --> 00:31:30.060
sort of whatever they're doing.

834
00:31:30.060 --> 00:31:31.360
They're emoting, right?

835
00:31:31.560 --> 00:31:32.420
Whatever their thing is.

836
00:31:32.740 --> 00:31:33.960
So, I remember the

837
